{{!--
  Plain text template for cargo-about (scripts/third-party-notices.sh).
  Triple braces: cargo-about does not turn off HTML escaping, so double braces
  would write &quot; into the license texts.
  The @@notedown lines are markers for the script. It drops a block without
  any crate line (a license used only by Notedown's own path crates, which
  have no registry source) and turns "@@notedown-crate" into a list item.
--}}
{{#each licenses}}
@@notedown-block
========================================================================
{{{name}}} ({{{id}}})
========================================================================

Used by:
{{#each used_by}}
{{#if crate.source}}
@@notedown-crate {{{crate.name}}} {{{crate.version}}}
{{/if}}
{{/each}}

{{{text}}}

@@notedown-end
{{/each}}
